      "sequence_position": 4,
      "problem": "$$\n\\{\\begin{aligned}{x}^{′}=2.5x-0.5xy \\\\ {y}^{′}=-4y+0.8xy\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nConsider the Lotka-Volterra model above for the functions $x(t)$ and $y(t).$ Select the correct options in the following statement.\n\n$\\,$\nTerm ${x}^{′}$ in the first equation represents the \n{{field-1}} \nof the \n{{field-2}}.",
